@page "/skills-extended/guides"
@layout GuideLayout
@attribute [AllowAnonymous]

<PageTitle>Mini-game guides · Skills Extended</PageTitle>
<header class="se-page-heading">
    <div>
        <p class="se-eyebrow">Player handbook</p>
        <h1>Mini-game guides</h1>
        <p>Learn the tools, read the feedback, and make your next attempt count. No sign-in required.</p>
    </div>
</header>
<div class="se-card-grid se-guide-cards">
    <a class="se-panel" href="/skills-extended/guides/lockpicking">
        <h2>Lockpicking</h2>
        <img src="/skills-extended/guides/lockpicking.png" alt="Pin tumbler lock with pick depth, lift and tension arrows." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" />
        <p>Find binding pins, manage tension, and work through security pins without breaking your pick.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="se-panel" href="/skills-extended/guides/hacking">
        <h2>Hacking</h2>
        <img src="/skills-extended/guides/hacking.png" alt="Connected hacking network with entrance, defenses, security core and utility slots." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" />
        <p>Explore the network, spend utilities wisely, and destroy the core before your coherence runs out.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="se-panel" href="/skills-extended/guides/signals">
        <h2>Signals Intelligence</h2>
        <img src="/skills-extended/guides/signals.png" alt="Receiver controls beside two bearings crossing over a supply cache search area." width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" />
        <p>Tune a transmission, record crossing bearings, and pair your PDA with a hidden supply cache.</p>
    </a>
</div>
<p class="se-notice">Availability, difficulty, attempts, rewards, and skill bonuses depend on your server's configuration. Controls shown in these guides are defaults; check the in-game BepInEx configuration menu for your bindings.</p>
